OL,3,GNEWSASinn Fein ministers facing
OL,4,Ano-confidence vote after Drumcree
OL,5,Adispute
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe first minister will face a
OL,8,Fno-confidence vote at Stormont on
OL,9,FMonday over her handling of the
OL,10,FDrumcree parading dispute.
OL,12,FThe motion against Michelle O'Neill and
OL,13,Fthree other Sinn Fein ministers will be
OL,14,Fdebated after it received the backing
OL,15,Fof unionist parties last week.
OL,17,FHowever the attempt to oust them will
OL,18,Ffail as it requires cross-community
OL,19,Fsupport from a majority of both
OL,20,Funionists and nationalists in the
OL,21,Fassembly.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
